# Cloudflare Pages redirects (P4b: the game moved from the root to
# /jack-in/). Pages cannot match a query string here, so the old game
# URLs with a query (a share code, ?stack, ?daily, a door) are sent on by
# the landing page's own script; this file carries the path-only rules.
# The old PWA's manifest, fetched by an installed app's update check:
/assets/manifest.webmanifest /jack-in/assets/manifest.webmanifest 301

# The devlog became News (2026-09-25). The pages are NOT redirected: the four
# essays were folded into the About page's History section, and David's read
# is that nobody was reading them at their old URLs anyway.
#
# These two are different, and the reason is easy to miss. An installed 0.1.1
# PWA fetches ../devlog/feed.json for its in-game NEWS screen, and it goes on
# doing that until the player takes an update. Without these, its news screen
# goes blank.
#
# TODO: drop these two once 0.1.1 installs are not worth carrying. They cost
# nothing, but they describe a URL that no longer exists.
/devlog/feed.json /news/feed.json 301
/devlog/feed.xml /news/feed.xml 301
